       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PGMREN.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT CTL-FILE ASSIGN TO UT-S-CTLIN.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD CTL-FILE.
       01 CTL-REC PIC X(80).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-REC.
          05 WS-FLAG PIC X.
          05 WS-KEY PIC X(3).
          66 WS-HEAD RENAMES WS-FLAG THRU WS-KEY.
          05 WS-PGM PIC X(8).
          05 FILLER PIC X(68).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           OPEN INPUT CTL-FILE
           READ CTL-FILE INTO WS-REC
           CALL WS-PGM ON EXCEPTION CONTINUE END-CALL
           CLOSE CTL-FILE
           GOBACK.
